     "t": "code",
     "lang": "python",
     "code": "\"\"\"\nThe queue module provides thread-safe queue implementations:\n\n  queue.Queue(maxsize=0)          — FIFO queue.\n  queue.LifoQueue(maxsize=0)      — LIFO queue (stack).\n  queue.PriorityQueue(maxsize=0)  — Priority queue (smallest item first).\n\nKey methods:\n  - put(item, block=True, timeout=None) — add item; block if full.\n  - get(block=True, timeout=None)       — remove and return item; block if empty.\n  - put_nowait(item) / get_nowait()     — non-blocking versions.\n  - task_done()  — signal that a previously dequeued item is processed.\n  - join()       — block until all items have been processed (task_done called\n                   for each get).\n  - qsize(), empty(), full()            — query status (approximate).\n\nQueues are the preferred way to communicate between threads because they\nhandle all locking internally. They are the backbone of producer-consumer\npatterns and work distribution systems.\n\"\"\"\nimport queue\nimport threading\n\nprint(\"Q284: Queues\")\n\n# FIFO Queue\nfifo = queue.Queue()\nfor item in [3, 1, 4, 1, 5]:\n    fifo.put(item)\nfifo_order = [fifo.get() for _ in range(5)]\nprint(f\"  FIFO Queue: {fifo_order}\")\n\n# LIFO Queue (Stack)\nlifo = queue.LifoQueue()\nfor item in [3, 1, 4, 1, 5]:\n    lifo.put(item)\nlifo_order = [lifo.get() for _ in range(5)]\nprint(f\"  LIFO Queue: {lifo_order}\")\n\n# Priority Queue\npq = queue.PriorityQueue()\nfor priority, task in [(3, \"low\"), (1, \"high\"), (2, \"medium\")]:\n    pq.put((priority, task))\npq_order = [pq.get() for _ in range(3)]\nprint(f\"  PriorityQueue: {pq_order}\")\n\n# Thread-safe example with task_done and join\nwork_queue = queue.Queue()\nresults_q284 = []\n\ndef worker_q284():\n    while True:\n        item = work_queue.get()\n        if item is None:\n            work_queue.task_done()\n            break\n        results_q284.append(item * 2)\n        work_queue.task_done()\n\nt = threading.Thread(target=worker_q284)\nt.start()\nfor i in range(5):\n    work_queue.put(i)\nwork_queue.put(None)  # Sentinel to stop\nwork_queue.join()\nt.join()\nprint(f\"  Worker results (doubled): {results_q284}\")\nprint()",
